reagent-name-dl-butt-growth = Glutosilin
reagent-desc-dl-butt-growth = Changes the size of the buttocks and hips by one stage per 5 units metabolized. If the part is missing, the first 5 units add it at its smallest size. Also affects hidden parts. Can exceed lobby limits within available sprite sizes. Changes last for the current round.
ent-PillDLButtGrowth = glutosilin pill
    .desc = Changes the size of the buttocks and hips by one stage per 5 units metabolized. If the part is missing, the first 5 units add it at its smallest size. Also affects hidden parts. Can exceed lobby limits within available sprite sizes. Changes last for the current round.
ent-PillCanisterDLButtGrowth = glutosilin pill canister
    .desc = Contains 7 pills with 5 units each.
