reagent-effect-guidebook-body-size = { $direction ->
    [1] Increases the size of the { $part } by one stage per { $units } units metabolized
   *[-1] Decreases the size of the { $part } by one stage per { $units } units metabolized
    }
    Growth reagent creates a missing feature at a concentration of at least { $threshold } units. Reduction never creates a missing feature.
